{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Applied to a bill for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44bd9b7e27b8bea4aa86377827a697b1e2b90ca2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar{10,000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> the difference between a discount of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% and two successive discounts of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />%, \nexpressed in dollars, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/722688a6e1f2b956d3cf327e00acb8a30f3609a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}0\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}144\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}256\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}400\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}416$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the discount of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% means you're only paying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% of the bill.  That results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/e/d7e5b23300b8bce4fdb90262733c9ab4d63a1197.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000\\cdot0.6=\\textdollar{6,000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"167\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Likewise, taking two discounts of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />% means taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />% of the original amount and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/367f6b15d47102fd8fdfc1bafed72c1daeadb35a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />% of the result.  That results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/48438a51456dd5a6673dbf3865fc8407c32f6caf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10,000\\cdot0.64\\cdot0.96=\\textdollar{6,144}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"222\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Taking the difference results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/3/cb3e88b89393f5cdc1e9a0542503348a25a55cb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6,144-6,000=\\textdollar{144}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"171\" height=\"17\" />, or answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a>